Raidió Corca Baiscinn 94.8 fm	Raidió Corca Baiscinn is a wholly community owned and run radio station based in West Clare. We broadcast on 94.8FM to the whole region of West Clare from Labasheeda through Kilmihil to Quilty and all points West to Loop Head and to the rest of the world online. Our programming is as diverse as our volunteers  and includes daily news, debate, farming, documentaries, sports, drama, soundscape, nature and a wide range of music shows from trad to hip hop, 90% of which are volunteer produced and presented. We broadcast from 2pm to 9pm each weekday and 2pm to 5pm on weekends.	Community	Ireland	English	http://37.187.90.121:3074/stream	http://cp.eu2.fastcast4u.com:2199/tunein/raidioco.asx	-	-	-	-
