The Blaze.com Radio Network	TheBlaze Radio Network is a brand new online radio channel that is your go-to source for news and entertainment. The exclusive home of renowned talk-radio personality and Marconi Award nominee Jay Severin, the TheBlaze Radio Network now welcomes veteran broadcaster Doc Thompson to its lineup. “The Morning Blaze with Doc Thompson" is a mix of topical stories and politics tackled with passion, fun, and entertainment, covering everything from day-to-day life to personal freedom and responsibility. Jay Severin’s program – “Jay Severin Show” – is a mix of political commentary and satire, with a mission of exposing the truth without barriers. The network’s lineup includes a simulcast of The Glenn Beck Radio Program and audio simulcasts of other TheBlaze TV shows. Plus, Glenn’s radio co-hosts – Pat Gray and Stu Burguiere – have expanded their show to two hours and can be heard for free on TheBlaze Radio Network.	Talk-News	USA	English	http://provisioning.streamtheworld.com/pls/BLZE_2AAC.pls	http://provisioning.streamtheworld.com/asx/BLZE_2.asx	http://provisioning.streamtheworld.com/asx/BLZE_2AAC.asx	http://provisioning.streamtheworld.com/pls/BLZE_2.pls	-	-
