Radio Wezi	WEZI-FM was a beautiful music radio station based in Memphis, Tennessee.  WEZI-FM was the Mid-South's source for relaxing and beautiful music from 1973-1990.  During its time as a beautiful music station, WEZI-FM broadcast from two different frequencies.  From 1973-1983, WEZI broadcast from FM 105.9.  From 1983-1990, WEZI played beautiful music from FM 94.3.  Many people who resided in the Mid-South during the '70s and '80s fondly remember WEZI-FM.  WEZI-DB is an online radio station inspired by WEZI-FM and the other classic American beautiful music stations.  WEZI-DB will feature the best beautiful music of yesterday and today.  If you listened to beautiful music radio in the '70s and '80s, this station will be a fun trip down memory lane.  However for many of you, this station will be an entirely new experience.  If you have never before listened to a beautiful music radio station, please take a few minutes to sample a music genre which was an important part of American radio and of American life for many	Jazz-Easy Listening	USA	English	http://199.180.72.2:8508/stream	-	-	-	-	-
