Mint Music Radio	What is Mint Music Radio?  Mint Music Radio is Independence!  Mint Music Radio is a non-genre specific internet radio station that was created for the following reasons.  To provide Mint Music Artist with an additional platform to showcase their talent.  To increase the fan base and brand recognition of the Mint Music Artist.  To provide Mint Music Artist (by way of Radionomy & registrars) with radio royalty compensation.  To provide Mint Music Artists, Mint Music Vendors & Mint Music Venues with an arena to advertise their products, services and events.  Mint Music Radio is a centrifugal force of independence that empowers the listener, the MM Artist and the MM creator. For example, just listening to MM Radio helps to increase exposure and royalty opportunities for the Mint Music Artist. Thereby, allowing the independent artist to either stay independent (financially) or to sign a favorable deal due to their increased global fan base (A&R's like popular artists).	Independent	USA	English	http://listen.radionomy.com/mintmusic.m3u	-	-	-	-	-
